------------Virtual dom
Virtual dom is not just a react concept.It is a software engineering concept.but react has its own concept
"It is the representation of dom in our code" (See Dom Virtual image)

Why do we need it?
We need virtual dom because of Reconsilitation in react
What is Reconsilitation/diff algorithum?
Reconsilitation is a algorithum that react uses to diff one tree from other.
=>React uses a Reconsilitation algorithum to differ one tree from other.It determines what needs to change in ui and what is not.
React behind the scenes real dom pr changes/data dikhany k liye virtual dom ko use krta ha.Let suppose app render hui,react ny uska virtual dom bnaya,jab b us me koi change hui tu react ny ek aur new virtual dom bnaya.By comparing the new virtual DOM with a old virtual DOM, React figures out exactly which virtual DOM objects have changed. This process is called “diffing.”

Once React knows which virtual DOM objects have changed, then React updates those objects, and only those objects, on the real DOM.
Thats makes the react FAST.This process also knowns as Reconsilitation.
=>React uses a Reconsilitation algorithum to find out the difference btw your latest virtual dom and previous virtual dom and then it finds out what needs to be updated and then update that specific part only in real dom instead of all the root.It does not re render all app.It just re render that small part.(see virtualImage1 in which not all the dom will update,see virtualImage2 in which only specific part will be updated)

SUMMARY

"Reconsilitation is the algorithm React uses to diff one tree with another to determine which parts need to be changed."

